{"id":"n71282-1-7","stage":2,"title":"신체 · 身体","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71282-1-7-1","ko":"어디 아픈 데는 없어?","zh":"哪里不舒服吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"3","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}},{"text":"아픈","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아픈","audio":"/audio/9277b72aca0bb2178064.mp3"}},{"text":"데는","meaning":"处所，地方。","explanation":"데：处所，地方。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"데","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47455","senseId":"1","lemma":"데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"데는","audio":"/audio/9cc42cbcded6eb4c0204.mp3"}},{"text":"없어?","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"3","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어","audio":"/audio/d3275bf98baed4550c12.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不确定的或难以准确表述的某个处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]},{"id":"16cb0f76ae2e2fc7","term":"데","zh":"处所，地方。","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3","entryId":"47455","definition":"处所，地方。","pronunciation":["데"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不发生某个事情或症状。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/0668a001592879eaa91a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71282-1-7-2","ko":"그럼. 내가 신체 하나는 튼튼한 사람이거든.","zh":"没有啊。我的身体可是很健康的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼.","meaning":"当然、可不是（肯定回答）","explanation":"그럼 这里是肯定回答的感叹词，用于确认自己没有不舒服；不是表示推论或转折的“那么”。","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62277","senseId":"1","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"신체","meaning":"身体","explanation":"신체：身体","readings":[{"term":"신체","audio":"/audio/f47a30d1c66416a93a77.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71282","senseId":"1","lemma":"신체","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"신체","audio":"/audio/f47a30d1c66416a93a77.mp3"}},{"text":"하나는","meaning":"其中","explanation":"하나：其中；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20283","senseId":"2","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나는","audio":"/audio/96dfc3407c61233001c6.mp3"}},{"text":"튼튼한","meaning":"强壮，坚固","explanation":"튼튼하다：强壮，坚固；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"튼튼하다","audio":"/audio/646fa517b1e63fe66868.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71480","senseId":"2","lemma":"튼튼하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"튼튼한","audio":"/audio/8ea6c7936d4502ddc4ba.mp3"}},{"text":"사람이거든.","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；거든：